# Append New Locale Keys at the End

**Rule:** When adding a new text/key to localization files (e.g. `app_language.dart`, `en.dart`, `vi.dart`), always append it at the **end** of the file (before the closing `}`) instead of inserting it between existing keys. This greatly reduces merge conflicts when multiple people add strings in parallel.

### ❌ Bad Example
```dart
  String get totalAmount;
  String get totalPrice; // inserted in the middle
  String get buyTicket;
```

### ✅ Good Example
```dart
  String get totalTicketPrice;
  String get discount;
  String get totalPrice; // appended at the end
}
```
